# 统一行尾：源码一律 LF（跨平台协作时不让 CRLF 制造整文件 diff）。
* text=auto
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf

# 二进制：别让 git 试图合并或转换它们
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
